<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>粉晶 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E7%B2%89%E6%99%B6/</link><description>Recent content in 粉晶 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E7%B2%89%E6%99%B6/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>七大脈輪配什麼水晶？選石對照與保養提醒</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想用顏色記住七輪，手邊剛好有幾顆石頭？可以對照看看；&lt;strong&gt;這份表是當代水晶文化的配色習慣，不是「哪顆石頭對哪種疾病有效」的表單&lt;/strong&gt;。沒有一顆石頭能替你診斷或「打通」脈輪。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>心輪是什麼？從關係與自我慈悲談綠色象徵</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在關係裡，你可能很會照顧別人，卻說不清自己需要什麼。心輪的綠色象徵可以當作提問入口：我願意付出什麼？我希望對方怎麼回應？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>處女座性格全解析：土象變動宮的分析力與服務之愛</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;處女座是十二星座裡，&lt;strong&gt;最容易被誤解的一個&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>